        <mxCell id="f3JazSe9_L1KnNGzIlD2-2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;Chat GPT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\(T \subseteq S\)&lt;div&gt;asks:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;“Is every element of T&amp;nbsp; also an element of S&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;This produces a truth value:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;\(T \subseteq S \in \{\mathrm{True}, \mathrm{False}\}&lt;br&gt;\)&lt;div&gt;Similarly,&lt;br&gt;\(S \subseteq T&lt;br&gt;\)&lt;br&gt;asks whether every element of \(S\) is in \(T\).&lt;br&gt;Then \(\iff\) compares the truth values of the two propositions.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
